cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its data, please cite it as below, and name the commit you used."
title: "Turmite: an empirical study of generalised Langton's ants"
type: software
abstract: >-
  Rust simulation code, results and notes on generalised Langton's ants
  (rules over {L, R}), asking why chaotic rules grow as t^(1/3) in width.
authors:
  - family-names: McNamara
    given-names: "T.S."
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2494-2700"
    affiliation: "Accelerant Limited"
